#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:5
msgid "Change element size"
msgstr "更改元素大小"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provide the feature of changing the size of the graphical "
"symbol from an `element`_. This feature is equivalent to the scale feature "
"from CAD tools and graphical vector editors."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了从 `元件 <element_>`_ 中更改图形符号大小的特性，这个特性相当于 CAD 工具和图形向量编辑器的尺度特性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:12
msgid ""
"QElectroTech version 0.7, does not provide the option of defining the "
"proportion to scale."
msgstr "QElectroTech版本0.7,没有提供定义比例与规模的选项。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:15
msgid "To change the size from element symbol:"
msgstr "要改变元素符号的大小："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:17
msgid "Open the `element`_ desired using the `element editor`_."
msgstr "打开 `元件 <element_>`_ 希望使用 `元素编辑器 <element editor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:18
msgid "`Select all element parts`_ from `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"` 从 `工作空间 <Select all element parts_>`_ 选择全部元素部件 <Select all element "
"parts_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:19
msgid ""
"Press one of the control points from the global element symbol rectangle "
"(green points from the figure)."
msgstr "从全局元素符号矩形(图中的绿点)按一个控制点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:24
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor workspace"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器工作空间"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:26
msgid "Move the point without releasing the left button of the mouse."
msgstr "移动点而不释放鼠标的左键 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/element_size.rst:27
msgid ""
"Once the element symbol has been scaled, `save changes`_ and `close element "
"editor`_."
msgstr ""
"一旦元素符号缩放，`save会改变 <save changes_>`_ 和 `close 元素编辑器 <close element "
"editor_>`_。"
